{"Title":"An Act relative to the expansion of bicycle lanes","BillNumber":"H3350","DocketNumber":"HD1864","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"PrimarySponsor":{"Id":"djh1","Name":"Daniel J. Hunt","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/djh1","ResponseDate":"2023-01-17T20:22:58.893"},"Cosponsors":[{"Id":"djh1","Name":"Daniel J. Hunt","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/djh1","ResponseDate":"2023-01-17T20:22:58.8933333"}],"JointSponsor":null,"BillHistory":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Documents/H3350/DocumentHistoryActions","LegislationTypeName":"Bill","Pinslip":"By Representative Hunt of Boston, a petition (accompanied by bill, House, No. 3350) of Daniel J. Hunt relative to the expansion of bicycle lanes.  Transportation.","DocumentText":"\tNotwithstanding any general law or special law to the contrary, a municipality that has received funding from the Commonwealth Transportation Fund established pursuant to section 2ZZZZ of chapter 29 of the General Laws or any other state assistance for transportation development and improvements shall conduct a study to expand the number of bicycle routes on public roadways within the municipality. The municipality shall submit a report including any findings and proposals to the clerks of the house of representatives and the senate, and to the house and senate chairs of the joint committee on transportation and the joint committee on municipalities and regional government not later than 180 days after the effective date of this act.\r\n","EmergencyPreamble":null,"RollCalls":[],"Attachments":[],"CommitteeRecommendations":[{"Action":"Favorable","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"J27","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/J27"},"Votes":[]},{"Action":"Place in OD","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"H52","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/H52"},"Votes":[]}],"Amendments":[]}